    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>Tubular conduits, generally leakproof, for the transport of liquids or gases. For assemblies of pipes, tubes, and fittings in plumbing systems, use "piping (plumbing system components)." [Source: Getty AAT]</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
